 73:    * release and would fire a second time on the frame the clip ends.
 74:    */
 75:   let castSent: object | null = null;
 76:   /** A summon already went out during the right button's current hold. */
 77:   let summonCast = false;
 78:   /**
 79:    * A Rage Fighter contact skill whose step has not landed yet. Beast
 80:    * Uppercut, Chain Drive and Dragon Slasher relocate the caster partway
 81:    * through the clip rather than as it starts (`IsRageHalfwaySkillAni` /
