 23: /**
 24:  * Shared plumbing for the effect entries (one entry per file next to this
 25:  * one). Not an entry itself: it owns the pools every entry draws from and the
 26:  * live-list class each entry keeps its own state in. Nothing here allocates
 27:  * per frame:
 28:  *
 29:  *  - `LiveList` steps an entry's running effects from `effects.update`;
 30:  *  - textures come from `loadEffectTexture` (one GPU texture per file, shared
 31:  *    with the map emitters and the item auras);
 32:  *  - additive `StandardMaterial`s are cached per (texture, colour) - MU's
 33:  *    `EnableAlphaBlend` drawn as `(SRC_ALPHA, ONE)` so `visibility` is the
 34:  *    fade (`ADDITIVE_ALPHA_MODE` below), and an additive material only
 35:  *    blends when `transparencyMode` is ALPHABLEND;
 36:  *  - billboard cards are `CreatePlane` meshes from a free-list;
 37:  *  - particle bursts are `ParticleSystem`s cached per recipe, emitted with
 38:  *    `manualEmitCount` so a burst is a counter bump, not an allocation;
 39:  *  - the effects clock (`fxNow`, `delay`) sequences a skill's steps.
 40:  *
 41:  * `disposePools()` + `clearTimers()` are the facade's reset for all of this.
 42:  */
