379: /** A pooled quad; unit-sized, so `scaling` is the edge in tiles. */
380: export type Card = Mesh;
381: 
382: /**
383:  * A sheet drawn one cell at a time - the original's
384:  * `RenderSprite(…, Frame % 4 * 0.25, Frame / 4 * 0.25, 0.25, 0.25)` on
385:  * BITMAP_EXPLOTION. `w`/`h` are the cell size in texels, `count` how many
386:  * cells hold frames (Explotion01 is 4×4 but only the first 10 are drawn - the
387:  * rest of the sheet is solid white, which is what a card showing the whole
